description=Target-scoped observation bypass for DuckDetector and TrustAttestor: Duck ADB Runtime USB_STATE sticky-broadcast flag cleared on the Binder reply, TrustAttestor (com.lingqing.trustattestor) ADB property profile via a direct GOT patch in libTrustAttestor.so, capability/feature bridge realignment, per-bridge hook diagnostics, USB/ADB property row hiding, robust libc property reads, refreshed native snapshot payloads, plus MIUI/HyperOS inventory appop fixer and SDK fallback. No pm hide, no ADB disable, no property-area writes.
